		{
			dependencies: ["1FE35B6B8FC14539"]
			description: ["&7Menril logs are the starting point of Integrated Dynamics: squeeze them to obtain Menril Resin, then dry that into Crystallized Menril for early machines and crafting. Menril trees are most easily found via Meneglin biomes, and a Squeezer beside a Drying Basin will turn a single log’s resin into a Block of Crystallized Menril over time."]
